<title>UK: BGL sets 110 milllion guilder bond.</title>
<headline>BGL sets 110 milllion guilder bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Generale du Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE GENERALE DU LUXEMBOURG SA</p>
<p> AMT    110 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    17.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.55    PAY DATE  L-17.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.875    SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  LUX	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT OCTOBER 2004 DSL</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
